      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Player movement & abilities\n\n- Implement movement\n- Implement rotation\n- Implement teleportation\n- Implement portals\n- Implement event responses\n- Implement slow-downs\n- Implement disorientation\n- Implement immortality\n- Implement enemy control\n- Implement buy time\n- Implement user life count",
