      "updated": 1759620705364,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Enemy AI\n\n- Some should use Random Walk with some Perlin noise or\nsomething\n- Some should use back-and-forth\n- Some should use DFS\n- Some should use BFS\n- Some should have A star\n- Some should use Djikstra\n - Some should use Flow Field\n- (Maybe) Enemies can use power-ups and abilities, just like\nthe player",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "i4sSfUFfKCh1oNfyewX1R",
      "originalText": "Enemy AI\n\n- Some should use Random Walk with some Perlin noise or something\n- Some should use back-and-forth\n- Some should use DFS\n- Some should use BFS\n- Some should have A star\n- Some should use Djikstra\n - Some should use Flow Field\n- (Maybe) Enemies can use power-ups and abilities, just like the player",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
