      "versionNonce": 720966191,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1759620705364,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Events\n\n- playerDie\n- enemyDie\n- enemyApproach\n- enemyMove\n- enemyDie\n- enemiesDisorient\n- powerUpSpawn\n- powerUpVanish\n- keySpawn\n- keyVanish\n- powerUpConsume\n- keyAcquire\n- playerCollide\n- keyRelocate\n\n\n- Events are fired only once by default\n- Perpetual events can be set\n- Listeners can always be removed\n- Event responses require power-ups",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "RxuDlY-Lytf4QaHUbIWF5",
      "originalText": "Events\n\n- playerDie\n- enemyDie\n- enemyApproach\n- enemyMove\n- enemyDie\n- enemiesDisorient\n- powerUpSpawn\n- powerUpVanish\n- keySpawn\n- keyVanish\n- powerUpConsume\n- keyAcquire\n- playerCollide\n- keyRelocate\n\n\n- Events are fired only once by default\n- Perpetual events can be set\n- Listeners can always be removed\n- Event responses require power-ups",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
