      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Code control\n\n- Implement scoping and recursion\n- Implement max call-stack level\n- Implement good error handling if needed\n- (Maybe) Add support for parallel commands\n- Have global objects that represent enemy data, player\ndata, powerUp data and so on\n- Handle errors gracefully\n- Implement basically everything using functions",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "aBBse0BFklioReceE-PWb",
      "originalText": "Code control\n\n- Implement scoping and recursion\n- Implement max call-stack level\n- Implement good error handling if needed\n- (Maybe) Add support for parallel commands\n- Have global objects that represent enemy data, player data, powerUp data and so on\n- Handle errors gracefully\n- Implement basically everything using functions",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
